OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to demand details of
OL,4,Aasylum seekers' housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council will ask the government to
OL,7,Fdisclose where asylum seekers are
OL,8,Fhoused within its jurisdiction, despite
OL,9,Fsafeguarding concerns raised by fellow
OL,10,Fcouncillors.
OL,12,FDurham County Council backed the
OL,13,Fmotion, put forward by councillor Dawn
OL,14,FBellingham, the portfolio holder for
OL,15,Fcommunities and civic resilience at the
OL,16,FReform-led authority.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39302
SC,0002
