PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1792700754
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to demand details of
OL,4,Aasylum seekers' housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the motion she called for the
OL,7,Fgovernment to disclose data detailing
OL,8,Fhow many asylum seekers would be housed
OL,9,Fin the county, where, and how long for
OL,10,F- and to halt any new placements
OL,11,Fpending further consultation.
OL,13,FDuring the debate, Green councillor
OL,14,FJonathan Elmer said he had "huge
OL,15,Fconcerns" about disclosing where people
OL,16,Fwere living, citing the threat of
OL,17,Fattacks.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
